4,NGEMBA - Encyclopaedia Africana,https://encyclopaediaafricana.com/ngemba/,"Ngemba (circa 1820-September, 1886), also known as Mata-Boike, was a famous warrior-leader of the Iboko and Mabale people, living at Makanza on the Zaire (now Congo) River, about 200 km (120 mi) north of what is now Mbandaka.",Ngemba,Niger-Congo
